      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please consider to pick this assets intead:\n\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/vfx/shaders/fullscreen-camera-effects/hx-volumetric-lighting-67665\n\nThis assets has potential of nice volumetric effects. And also supports forward and single pass stereo rendering.",
